From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 03:29:34 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] ieframe: WebBrowser host notifications, UI activation, Stop
 and IDocHostShowUI

Navigation fires PropertyChange before BeforeNavigate2, the first load reports
the download state to the container's command target, a later load asks the
container for its UI info again, the frame gets EnableModeless around a
download, GetDropTarget, ShowUI and HideUI are forwarded to the container's
IDocHostUIHandler (HideUI only for a ShowUI that was accepted, or at once for
one that was refused), the document's OnUIActivate asks the container for
UI activation, Tab and F6 are taken by the control site, EnumVerbs has the
sixth verb, get_Busy fails before the control has a container, Stop stops
the document and QueryStatusWB reports Stop as enabled. The document's client
site answers IDocHostShowUI and hands messages to the container's one.

